{"id":"cliche_","lemma":"cliché","pos":"noun","rank":4704,"glosses":["stereotype (printing plate)","negative","snapshot"],"ipa":"/kli.ʃe/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-clich%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-clich%C3%A9.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"clichés"},"formAudio":{"clichés":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-clich%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un vieux cliché.","en":"It's an old stereotype.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"old"},null]},{"text":"Évite les clichés.","en":"Avoid clichés.","words":[{"g":"to avoid","l":"éviter"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Voici un cliché de ma femme à la plage.","en":"This is a snapshot of my wife on the beach.","words":[{"g":"here is"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"woman"},null,null,{"g":"beach"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"a la"]]},{"text":"La police a pris quelques clichés du théâtre de l'accident.","en":"The police took some pictures of the scene of the accident.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"theatre (venue for…"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"accident"}]},{"text":"C'est un cliché, mais c'est vrai.","en":"It's a cliche, but it's true.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"true"}]}]}